'''''Star Wars: Tales of the Empire''''' is a six-part animated anthology series and the second part of the [[Star Wars Tales (television series)|''Star Wars Tales'']] anthology series, following the first season, [[Star Wars: Tales of the Jedi (television series)|''Star Wars: Tales of the Jedi'']]. It focuses on the characters [[Barriss Offee]] and [[Morgan Elsbeth]] during the [[Imperial Era]]. First announced at [[Celebration Europe (2023)|Celebration Europe]] [[2023]] as simply the second season of ''Tales of the Jedi'', it was formally announced as ''Tales of the Empire'' with the release of a trailer on [[April 4]], [[2024]] with a release date of [[May 4]]. A sequel season, ''[[Star Wars: Tales of the Underworld]]'', was announced on [[April 2]], [[2025]] and released on [[May 4]], 2025.

